OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 13 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Martin Hayes Turns the
OL,5,     FTune
OL,6,     GIn conversation with Olivia
OL,7,     GO'Leary, Martin Hayes describes
OL,8,     Glearning the fiddle as
OL,9,     Gtraditional musicians have for
OL,10,     Gcenturies and regional styles in
OL,11,     Gdifferent parts of Ireland.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
OL,18,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,19,     GSoweto is back with another week
OL,20,     Gof the best in jazz, and he
OL,21,     Gwelcomes leading saxophonist Mark
OL,22,     GLockheart as his guest.
